        "0": {
          "$deleted": false,
          "details": "<p>When Eberon hits a creature with an attack, all hit creature is inflicted with @UUID[JournalEntry.NJ3m3y7QVBMDdc2Z]{Soulbroken}.</p>\n<p>Only activate once for each attack.</p>",
          "icon": "",
          "macro_name": "",
          "roll": "",
          "special_name": "The Defiler"
        },
        "1": {
          "$deleted": false,
          "details": "<p>During <img src=\"https://assets.forge-vtt.com/610d918102e7ac281373ffcb/Skill%20Icon/FFXIVIcons%20Battle(PvE)/08_DRG/blood_for_blood.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"21\" height=\"21\"><strong>@UUID[JournalEntry.GJevbCPM8cffm1QM]{Crisis}</strong>, all attacks of the <strong>Eberon</strong> have increased <strong>Accuracy</strong> and <strong>Damage</strong> equals to the <strong>amount of buff and debuff it is currently having.</strong></p>",
          "icon": "",
          "macro_name": "",
          "roll": "",
          "special_name": "Cornered Monster"
        },
        "2": {
          "$deleted": true,
          "details": "",
          "icon": "",
          "roll": "",
          "special_name": "Lava Infused"
        },
        "3": {
          "$deleted": false,
          "details": "<p>While <strong>Umbral</strong><strong>&nbsp;Infused</strong>, Eberon is resistance to&nbsp;<strong>Physical, Fire </strong>and&nbsp;<strong>Light&nbsp;</strong>damage and loses all Vulnerability to <strong>Weapons.</strong></p>",
          "icon": "",
          "macro_name": "",
          "roll": "",
          "special_name": "Umbral Armor"
        },
        "4": {
          "$deleted": false,
          "details": "<p>While <strong>Umbral</strong><strong>&nbsp;Infused</strong>, if hit with&nbsp;<strong>Ice&nbsp;</strong>damage, reduces duration of <strong>Umbral</strong><strong>&nbsp;Infused</strong> by <strong>1&nbsp;</strong>round.</p>\n<p>If <strong>Umbral</strong><strong>&nbsp;Infused </strong>is removed in this way, Eberon receives&nbsp;<strong>3 Break Clock progresses.</strong></p>",
          "icon": "",
          "macro_name": "",
          "roll": "",
          "special_name": "Dispersing Shadow"
        },
        "5": {
          "$deleted": false,
          "details": "<p>Eberon receives <strong>1&nbsp;</strong>Zero power clock progresses when any creature enters <img src=\"https://assets.forge-vtt.com/610d918102e7ac281373ffcb/Skill%20Icon/FFXIVIcons%20Battle(PvE)/08_DRG/blood_for_blood.png\" width=\"17\" height=\"17\"><strong>@UUID[JournalEntry.GJevbCPM8cffm1QM]{Crisis}</strong></p>",
          "icon": "",
          "macro_name": "",
          "roll": "",
          "special_name": "【Zero Trigger】 Soul Feasting"
        }
      },
